 ],
 "synopsis": "Chennai-based GRT Jewellers has launched a ₹431-crore open offer to acquire the remaining 25.88 per cent public shareholding in Tribhovandas Bhimji Zaveri. This move follows GRT's recent acquisition of approximately a 75 per cent promoter stake in TBZ for ₹1,034 crore via a Special Purchase Agreement signed last month. The open offer is priced at ₹249.61 per share for 1,72,70,845 shares. Through these transactions, GRT Jewellers aims to consolidate ownership of the legacy brand, expand into northern markets, and build a pan-India presence.",
